{"response_code":200,"body":{"id":45309979,"created":0,"created_by":94125542,"title":"U1S1 Analytical Paragraph","total_points":100,"realm":"course","realm_id":7919129162,"is_tracked":false,"rows":[{"id":126535665,"is_published":false,"term_id":null,"guid":"","title":"Answer\/Thesis Statement","description":"","columns":[{"pts":20,"description":"Distinguished\nOverall argument is original and shows complexity of thought \nAll parts of the question are answered precisely in one strongly worded cohesive sentence"},{"pts":17,"description":"Proficient\nOverall argument is obvious \u0026\/or general OR\nOne part of the question is answered, but the second part is missing OR\nAll parts of the question are answered in an incohesive manner\n--Multiple sentences\n--Poor word choice\n--Awkward sentence structure\n--Uses first or second person pronouns\n--Is not universal"},{"pts":14,"description":"Developing\nOverall argument is present with inaccuracies OR\nArgument is not based on one or both selections OR\nArgument is too general, vague, or unclear to determine whether it is reasonable"},{"pts":11,"description":"Emerging\nOverall argument is absent OR \nOverall argument is incorrect"}],"max_points":20,"weight":1},{"id":126535666,"is_published":false,"term_id":null,"guid":"","title":"Evidence","description":"The use of direct quotes from the text\nNo evidence = automatic rewrite","columns":[{"pts":30,"description":"Distinguished\nQuotes skillfully embedded, less than ten words, and accurately cited.\nFor all text selections, evidence is well chosen \nAll evidence specifically and clearly supports the argument \nAppropriate amount of context provided"},{"pts":27,"description":"Proficient\nQuotes adequately embedded, AND\/OR quote is too long, AND\/OR quote is not cited accurately.\nFor all text selections, the text evidence is accurate and relevant to the argument\nToo much or too little context was provided"},{"pts":24,"description":"Developing\nQuotes inadequately embedded AND\/OR quote is not cited\nFor some or all text selections, the text evidence is flawed and does not adequately support the argument due to it being too general, too partial, too weakly linked, or used inappropriately\nNo context was provided"},{"pts":21,"description":"Emerging\nEvidence is missing or paraphrased for one or all selections\nNo attempt at embedding\nEvidence does not connect to the student\u2019s argument"}],"max_points":30,"weight":2},{"id":126535667,"is_published":false,"term_id":null,"guid":"","title":"Commentary","description":"An in-depth discussion of the author\u2019s purpose--the how and why the ideas and evidence support the inference","columns":[{"pts":30,"description":"Distinguished\nFor all selections, the idea is perceptive and reflects an awareness of the complexities of the texts\nIdeas are overall insightful\nIdeas contain original inferences and analysis of the evidence provided"},{"pts":27,"description":"Proficient\nFor all selections, the ideas are reasonable and go beyond a literal reading of the texts. \nIdeas have some insight, but includes some superficial or basic discussion\nIdeas contain some inferences and analysis of the evidence provided, but are in need of elaboration\n27"},{"pts":24,"description":"Developing\nThe ideas are reasonable for all selections, but may be vague or reveal a literal or basic understanding of the texts.\nIdeas attempt to provide limited insight, but is mostly summary"},{"pts":21,"description":"Emerging\nNo insight is provided for selected evidence OR\nThe ideas cannot be considered commentary because it merely repeats verbatim, or \u201cechoes,\u201d the text evidence"}],"max_points":30,"weight":3},{"id":126535668,"is_published":false,"term_id":null,"guid":"","title":"Organization \u0026 Language","description":"Structure moves the reader logically and smoothly through the piece\nThe writer\u2019s use of diction \u0026 syntax","columns":[{"pts":10,"description":"Distinguished\nUse of seamless transitional devices\nWell-constructed paragraph\nVaried and purposeful sentence structure\nPrecise, purposeful, \u0026 powerful word choice that is appropriate for the task"},{"pts":7,"description":"Proficient\nUse of  effective transitional words\nParagraph sufficiently organized\nVaried sentence structure\nEffective word choice that is appropriate for the task"},{"pts":4,"description":"Developing\nUse of  ineffective transitional words\nParagraph disorganized\nRepetitive sentence structure\nAdequate word choice that is somewhat appropriate for the task"},{"pts":1,"description":"Emerging\nLack of transitional words\nParagraph lacks organization                \nChoppy and\/or repetitive sentence structure\nIneffective or inappropriate word choice for the task"}],"max_points":10,"weight":4},{"id":126535669,"is_published":false,"term_id":null,"guid":"","title":"Conventions","description":"Spelling, grammar, punctuation, capitalization, etc.","columns":[{"pts":10,"description":"Distinguished\nLittle to no convention or typographical errors are present."},{"pts":7,"description":"Proficient\nA few convention and\/or typographic errors are present that do not detract from the message"},{"pts":4,"description":"Developing\nSeveral convention and\/or typographical errors are present that do detract from the message"},{"pts":1,"description":"Emerging\nMany conventions and\/or typographical errors are present that severely hinder reader understanding and detract from the message."}],"max_points":10,"weight":5}],"num_assigned_gi":1}}